    """
    Finds the length of the longest strictly increasing subsequence in the given array.

    Approach:
    We use dynamic programming where dp[i] represents the length of the longest increasing
    subsequence ending at nums[i]. For each element, we look at all previous elements
    and update dp[i] if a longer increasing subsequence is found.

    Args:
    nums (List[int]): The input array of integers.

    Returns:
    int: The length of the longest strictly increasing subsequence.
